Nope, I'm used to things being a lot more serious.

00:26:49.090 --> 00:26:52.170
Oh, does that mean you don't like it here?

00:26:52.350 --> 00:26:55.030
No, it means it's time for a change.

00:26:55.700 --> 00:26:59.960
Tanya, would you like to visit me at Shining Times Day?

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:04.710
Matt, it's Harry.

00:27:05.570 --> 00:27:07.530
Would you please run and fetch me my toolbox?

00:27:10.040 --> 00:27:12.100
This station needs a little loving care.

00:27:12.400 --> 00:27:15.310
I want to get started as soon as possible.

00:27:17.580 --> 00:27:19.040
Thank you, son.

00:27:19.520 --> 00:27:21.440
I think we're going to be friends.

00:27:24.720 --> 00:27:27.280
Did you decide to stay at Shining Time Station?

00:27:28.440 --> 00:27:29.660
It's hard to say exactly.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:35.400
but there's just something about this place.

00:28:00.476 --> 00:28:02.476
Where dreams can come true

00:28:03.420 --> 00:28:05.340
I'm waiting there for you.

00:28:08.380 --> 00:28:08.620
See.

00:28:09.500 --> 00:28:13.500
So far to travel, so much to learn to know.

00:28:15.100 --> 00:28:16.380
Friends by your side

00:28:17.052 --> 00:28:21.112
Hopes to hold on to who knows how far you'll go.

00:28:23.228 --> 00:28:26.028
Jewish Shining Time Station

00:28:26.908 --> 00:28:28.908
Where dreams can come true

00:28:30.700 --> 00:28:35.660
Your imagination waiting there for you
